  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed development would harm the appearance of the front elevation of the property by creating a cramped, unbalanced appearance, specifically as a result of the car parking space layout. Therefore the proposal fails to comply with policy ENV.B.1.1 (All New Development). The parking space layout also does not allow independent access for two vehicles, which is considered unacceptable. Furthermore the proposed 1.6m walls, within 1.0m of the proposed vehicle access would create a hindrance to vehicle sightlines and in turn harm pedestrian and vehicle safety. Therefore the proposed development is not in accordance with policies T.4.4 and T.5.3 of the adopted London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan."
